group blade region bladereg
set group blade diameter 2.000000e-04
set group blade density 2165.0
fix plate all wall/gran model hertz tangential history  rolling_friction epsd2 primitive type 2 zplane 0.0
fix dam all wall/gran model hertz tangential history  rolling_friction epsd2 primitive type 2 xplane 1.250000e-03
region heapreg block 1.350000e-03 9.0e-3 0. 4.250000e-03 0.3e-3 9.5e-3 units box
group grains region heapreg
fix ins grains insert/pack seed 86028157 distributiontemplate pdd insert_every once overlapcheck yes all_in yes particles_in_region 2500 region heapreg ntry_mc 20000
fix integr grains nve/sphere
fix bmove blade move linear 0.0 0.0 0.0
variable t equal time
thermo_style custom step time atoms ke
thermo 2432
thermo_modify lost ignore norm no flush yes
dump dmp all custom 973 dump/p.*.txt id type radius x y z vx vy vz
run 9729
unfix dam
unfix bmove
fix bmove blade move linear 0.05 0.0 0.0
run 34051
unfix bmove
fix bmove blade move linear 0.0 0.0 0.0
run 2919
